{"duration": 59.026, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A Roman undertaker painted a dead noble's face, then burned him.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.704}, {"beat": 0, "text": "The body lay on a funeral couch, posed like someone eating dinner.", "start": 3.924, "end": 7.207}, {"beat": 0, "text": "The family kept it at home for seven or more days.", "start": 7.427, "end": 9.875}, {"beat": 1, "text": "In 79 BC, Sulla was the first from his noble Roman family to be cremated.", "start": 10.295, "end": 15.313}, {"beat": 1, "text": "His family had buried its dead instead of burning them.", "start": 15.533, "end": 18.249}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Sulla feared Marius's supporters would deface his body.", "start": 18.469, "end": 21.178}, {"beat": 2, "text": "By the 1st and 2nd centuries, cremation was Rome's most common practice.", "start": 21.598, "end": 25.797}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Only a few noble families still chose burial.", "start": 26.017, "end": 28.709}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The dead were thought to pollute the living.", "start": 28.929, "end": 30.636}, {"beat": 2, "text": "For commoners, disposal took less than one day.", "start": 30.856, "end": 33.354}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, honoring the dead was like keeping a promise to family.", "start": 33.774, "end": 36.968}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Romans believed proper rites made ancestors protect their descendants.", "start": 37.188, "end": 40.979}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Fire left ashes, not a body for enemies to deface.", "start": 41.399, "end": 44.521}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The family buried those ashes beside the cremation site.", "start": 44.741, "end": 47.668}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Relatives still visited the family tomb with food and wine.", "start": 47.888, "end": 50.891}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The sealed lead coffin was English law, not Roman custom.", "start": 51.311, "end": 54.568}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Rome's elite chose fire; English lead could ripple and tear.", "start": 54.788, "end": 57.906}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.195, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Roman", "start": 0.27, "end": 0.57, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "undertaker", "start": 0.62, "end": 1.17, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "painted", "start": 1.22, "end": 1.52, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.545, "end": 1.595, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "dead", "start": 1.67, "end": 1.895, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "noble's", "start": 1.945, "end": 2.32, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "face,", "start": 2.37, "end": 2.945, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "then", "start": 2.995, "end": 3.17, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "burned", "start": 3.22, "end": 3.495, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "him.", "start": 3.52, "end": 3.749, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "The", "start": 3.99, "end": 4.04, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "body", "start": 4.09, "end": 4.365, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "lay", "start": 4.415, "end": 4.59, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "on", "start": 4.615, "end": 4.69, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 4.715, "end": 4.74, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "funeral", "start": 4.815, "end": 5.165, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "couch,", "start": 5.215, "end": 5.79, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "posed", "start": 5.84, "end": 6.14, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "like", "start": 6.165, "end": 6.29, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "someone", "start": 6.34, "end": 6.615, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "eating", "start": 6.665, "end": 6.915, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "dinner.", "start": 6.965, "end": 7.252, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "The", "start": 7.492, "end": 7.567, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "family", "start": 7.617, "end": 7.992, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "kept", "start": 8.042, "end": 8.267, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "it", "start": 8.292, "end": 8.342, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "at", "start": 8.367, "end": 8.417, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "home", "start": 8.467, "end": 8.767, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "for", "start": 8.817, "end": 8.917, "line